  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Y0sEV7G.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"337\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Animal Bikes — это мод, который добавляет множество крафтимых ездовых животных. У каждого из них есть особая забавная способность.</p>\n<p><strong>Транспортные средства</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Эндер-дракон</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fchinesedragon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Китайский дракон</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252firongolem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Железный голем</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252freindeer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Олень</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fsnowgolem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Снежный голем</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fnotch\" rel=\"nofollow\">Нотч</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fcow\" rel=\"nofollow\">Корова</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fender\" rel=\"nofollow\">Эндермен</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fpig\" rel=\"nofollow\">Свинья</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fsheep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Овца</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fspider\" rel=\"nofollow\">Паук</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fchicken\" rel=\"nofollow\">Курица</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fsquid\" rel=\"nofollow\">Спрут</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fwolf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Волк</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fcreeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">Крипер</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fpony\" rel=\"nofollow\">Пони</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fghast\" rel=\"nofollow\">Гаст</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fdino\" rel=\"nofollow\">Динозавр</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fbunny\" rel=\"nofollow\">Кролик</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fchocobo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Чокобо</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fsilverfish\" rel=\"nofollow\">Чешуйница</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fbat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Летучая мышь</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252fslime\" rel=\"nofollow\">Слизень</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fanimalbikes%252focelot\" rel=\"nofollow\">Оцелот</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Хотите поддержать меня? Станьт